message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Crypto Payment Gateways Dataset"
type: dataset
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/ShieldZCash/crypto-payment-gateways-dataset"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShieldZCash/crypto-payment-gateways-dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open, hand-verified dataset of 86 crypto payment gateways classified by
  custody model, platform fee, KYC requirement, coin coverage, fiat settlement
  and Lightning support, from provider pricing pages and docs as of August 2026.
  Updated monthly. Headline finding: 64% of gateways are custodial, 24% are
  non-custodial (study cohort, n=50).
